@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-01  Register and review an application
' Requirements: PERM-01 PERM-02 PERM-05 ACC-01 ACC-02 ACC-03 ACC-04 ACC-05 ACC-06 ACC-07 ACC-08 ACC-20 NOTICE-01 NOTICE-02 P-01 P-03
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Applicant" as A
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Authorized reviewer" as R
A -> S: Register with required identity and credential details
alt Invalid fields or identity already belongs to an account
  S --> A: Explain correction or existing-account recovery
else Valid new application
  S --> A: Request email verification
  A -> S: Verify control of registered email
  S --> A: Show Pending application and limited access
  R -> S: Open application details for review
  S --> R: Show only the information needed for verification
  note over R
  Students: approved Faculty or Administrator
  checks name and student number against external list.
  Faculty: Administrator checks school records,
  employee ID in person, and applicant email ownership.
  end note
  R -> S: Submit review decision and applicable reason
  alt Approved
    S --> A: Show Approved role access; email decision
  else Needs correction
    S --> A: Show correction reason; email decision
    A -> S: Correct and resubmit the same application
    S --> A: Return to Pending for another review
  else Rejected
    S --> A: Show reason and application-only access; email decision
    note over A,S
    No applicant resubmission from Rejected.
    Only Administrator may verify an error,
    record a reason, and reopen as Pending.
    end note
  end
end
note over S
Email failure never reverses a saved decision.
Show current state in permitted dashboards.
Administrator account support sees delivery failure,
without private learning content.
Retry delivery only; never repeat the decision (P-01).
No automatic school-system checks or term renewal.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-01 | Product behavior
@enduml
